[statement]
A field whose lowercase letter apk does not know draws a warning that the
package might not function properly, and apk installs the package. apk
knows `a c f g i k m o p q r s t`.

[repository]
P:app
V:1.0-r0
x:1
g:1

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
| WARNING: This apk-tools is OLD! Some packages might not function properly.
install app 1.0-r0
